    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOH2Qg5s6NLuNh",
      "title": "p2p/enode: add back DNS hostname resolution at parsing time",
      "author": "sebastianst",
      "number": 531,
      "body": "**Description**\r\n\r\n- removed in https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/pull/30822 in favor of on-demand runtime dialling\r\n- reported to have removed bootnodes DNS resolution at https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/issues/31208\r\n- possibly broke DNS resolution for other methods of adding peers\r\n\r\nThis is a quick fix until upstream has implemented a proper fix.\r\n\r\n**Tests**\r\n\r\nNone added, code copied from https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/pull/30822\r\n\r\n\r\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/op-geth",
      "createdAt": "2025-03-03T17:09:41Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 32,
      "deletions": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOH2Qg5s5lMWCX",
      "title": "common: Let Hex2Bytes and Hex2BytesFixed panic for invalid hex strings",
      "author": "sebastianst",
      "number": 227,
      "body": "See upstream https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/pull/28884 for details",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/op-geth",
      "createdAt": "2024-01-26T20:20:25Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 14,
      "deletions": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOH2Qg5s5oNRhS",
      "title": "core,params: Don't rewind chain on pre-genesis time changes",
      "author": "sebastianst",
      "number": 257,
      "body": "**Description**\r\n\r\n* Fixes an underflow bug when calculating the timestamp to rewind a chain to.\r\n* Ignores chain rewinds if the timestamp changes are pre-genesis.\r\n\r\n**Tests**\r\n\r\nWill test on a devnet.\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n\r\nWe had a chain rewind on our internal `sepolia-devnet-0` on Jan 29 because the Canyon activation time changed from `0` to `1698436800` (`Fri Oct 27 20:00:00 UTC 2023`) when we set Base's Canyon activation time as the canonical time in the superchain-registry but didn't overwrite it to 0 again.\r\n\r\nThis change allows us to overwrite the Canyon activation time on `sepolia-devnet-0` back to `0` without causing another chain rewind.\r\n\r\nWe might want to upstream (parts of) this.\r\n\r\n**Metadata**\r\n\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/client-pod/issues/624\r\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/op-geth",
      "createdAt": "2024-02-28T18:50:23Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 11,
      "deletions": 5
    }
  ],
